<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bidvest details rights offer.</title>
<headline>Bidvest details rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial holding company the Bidvest Group Ltd said on Thursday that it would offer shareholders and debenture holders 8.9 million new ordinary shares of five cents each.</p>
<p>The rights offer will apply to those registered on March 14.</p>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange has granted a listing to the new shares and the listing will commence on April 18.</p>
<p>A detailed circular will be posted to shareholders and debenture holders on March 20.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
